### 1. Create first task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Learn Express"}

### 2. Create second task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Build React frontend"}

### 3. Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

### 4. Get one task
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1

### 5. Mark task 1 as done
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"done": true}

### 6. Invalid input (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. Task not found (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/99

### 8. Delete task 2
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/2